KL_gptp_shadow.sv`), so the parent's elaborated netlist and ROM digests must not change. Show this with the parent's Yosys elaboration of the gPTP plane, in a scratch parent at dev `ac2c5e77` with the gitlink at your head.\n\n**Proof.**\n- A directed test that raises `rx_err_i` for one byte at every byte position of a Sync, a Follow_Up, a Pdelay_Req and a Pdelay_Resp: each is dropped with drops +1 and events +0. Error-free controls dispatch. A held-to-eof error still drops exactly once.\n- A planted control restoring the end-of-frame-only read fails by name.\n- The donor gates pass: `make tb` (engine, gaskets, tsngen mutants), `make contract`, `make lint`, `make docs`.\n\nNo parent adoption is needed until the next batched adoption. Post TAKEN, then REVIEW READY (or STOP) with the head.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/comments/6104916029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/comments/6104922026","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/35#issuecomment-6104922026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/FPGA-gPTP/issues/35","id":6104922026,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT4nUSs8AAAABa-G3qg","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github